# redaction, release metadata, CI, and the agent-instruction boundary.
# The master branch ruleset enforces "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# Note for the solo maintainer: GitHub does not count a PR author's own
# approval, so PRs from @captain-corgi touching these paths need a second
# reviewer or an explicit admin merge decision.

